121 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 82 0 R
/E (The objective of this project is to build a desktop application that recommends recipes based on mood, available ingredients, and nutrition goals. The application allows users to log their daily mood and track eating patterns over time, while providing visually engaging recipe suggestions through cards showing prep time, nutrition information, and a comfort-versus-energy rating. It also demonstrates the practical integration of core Java, JDBC, and MySQL in a real-world application.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
