/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (The system successfully generates mood-based recipe recommendations from a sample dataset, with visual cards presenting recipe details clearly and intuitively. History tracking reveals meaningful patterns, such as a tendency toward comfort-food selection on stressed days. The discussion also considers system performance with larger datasets and the accuracy of mood-suitability tagging as areas for further refinement.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
